{"id":"e7f727658115b818","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-return-time.md","title":"Return Time","display":"df-return-time — Return Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-return-time","aliases":["58-df-return-time"],"display":"df-return-time — Return Time","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-iteration]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-return-time"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-return-time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-return-time — Return Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdcaf927aa04d82b\" href=\"?note=bdcaf927aa04d82b\" title=\"58-df-iteration\">58-df-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,T,A,X,x\\in V\">\\(t,T,A,X,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in X^X\">\\(T\\in X^X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n(x)\">\\(T^n(x)\\)</span> is the finite iterate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdcaf927aa04d82b\" href=\"?note=bdcaf927aa04d82b\" title=\"58-df-iteration\">58-df-iteration</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}return\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S(t,T,A,X,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in A\\land t\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\omega\\}\\land\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land\nt=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:T^n(x)\\in A\\}\\;\\lor\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land t=\\omega\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}return\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S(t,T,A,X,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in A\\land t\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\omega\\}\\land\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land\nt=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:T^n(x)\\in A\\}\\;\\lor\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land t=\\omega\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The no-return case is represented by the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, which is disjoint from the positive finite return times.  This makes the codomain an actual ZFC set rather than relying on an undeclared point at infinity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"bdcaf927aa04d82b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"bdcaf927aa04d82b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\in X^X$, $A\\subseteq X$, and $x\\in A$; $T^n(x)$ is the finite iterate from [[58-df-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t,T,A,X,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in X^X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"T^n(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}return\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ReturnTime}_S(t,T,A,X,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in A\\land t\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\omega\\}\\land\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land\nt=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:T^n(x)\\in A\\}\\;\\lor\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;T^n(x)\\in A\\bigr)\\land t=\\omega\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}